  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/IMG_6411.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(69 fotos) Unas 240 personas han participado a mediod&iacute;a de este jueves en el concurso de paellas, organizado por la Comisi&oacute;n de Fiestas de Ribesalbes. Tambi&eacute;n se han cocinado, fuera de concurso, alguna fideu&agrave;, e incluso un arroz con bogavante.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/PasquaRibesalbes2427març.jpg\" style=\"width: 279px; height: 395px;\" /></p>\n<p>La Comisi&oacute;n de Fiestas ha preparado varios actos tambi&eacute;n este viernes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesribesalbespasqua16/img_6317.jpg\" alt=\"img_6317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesribesalbespasqua16/img_6318.jpg\" alt=\"img_6318\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesribesalbespasqua16/img_6320.jpg\" alt=\"img_6320\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesribesalbespasqua16/img_6321.jpg\" alt=\"img_6321\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesribesalbespasqua16/img_6323.jpg\" alt=\"img_6323\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesribesalbespasqua16/img_6324.jpg\" alt=\"img_6324\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesribesalbespasqua16/img_6325.jpg\" alt=\"img_6325\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellesribesalbespasqua16/img